{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2023-06-01 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS MAY SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., JUNE 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $18.45 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF MAY, THE FOUR WEEKS ENDED MAY 28, 2023, AN INCREASE OF 1.2 PERCENT FROM $18.23 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}